<title>USA: Rowan Cos Q1 net income per share rises.</title>
<headline>Rowan Cos Q1 net income per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.05		    $0.03</p>
<p> Net		 4,153		    2,357</p>
<p> Revs		144,765		  126,808</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  88,317		   86,920</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Rowan Cos Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 net income before extraordinary charge was 7.6 million, or $0.09 per share, compared to $2.4 million or $0.03 per share for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>The $3.5 million charge was from the early redemption of $50 million of the company's 11 7/8 percent senior notes.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 net per share was $0.16.</p>
</text>
